Your list can now hold more than one place per timezone — Tampa and New York can both be on it, each keeping its own name. Ports of call appear on the map: point at one to see when the ship arrives, tap it to bring up the cruise that calls there, and keep it as a clock. Ship routes read more clearly, and the map's highlights are lighter so you can see what is underneath. Widgets show more clocks and mark a port with an anchor. Better time sync between the app and your device.
